#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:2
msgid "Documentation notifications"
msgstr "文档通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:4
msgid ""
"Documentation notifications alert users to information about the "
"documentation they are viewing. These notifications can be enabled or "
"disabled by the project maintainer, and are displayed to the user in the "
"rendered documentation."
msgstr "文档通知向用户提示其所查看文档的相关信息。这些通知可由项目维护者启用或禁用，并在渲染后的文档中显示给用户。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:11
msgid "The current notifications are:"
msgstr "当前的通知有："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Pull request warning**: Show a notification on builds from pull requests, "
"with a link back to the pull request for giving feedback."
msgstr "**Pull Request 警告**：在 Pull Request 构建上显示通知，并提供返回 Pull Request 的链接以便反馈。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Latest version warning**: Show a notification on latest version, warning "
"users that they are reading docs from a development version."
msgstr "**最新版本警告**：在最新版本上显示通知，提醒用户正在阅读开发版本的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Non-stable version warning**: Show a notification on non-stable versions, "
"warning users that they are reading docs from a non-stable release."
msgstr "**非稳定版本警告**：在非稳定版本上显示通知，提醒用户正在阅读非稳定发布的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:18
msgid "Manage notifications"
msgstr "管理通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:20
msgid "To manage notifications for your project:"
msgstr "管理项目通知："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:22
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Notifications`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Notifications`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/doc-notifications.rst:23
msgid "Configure each notification."
msgstr "逐项配置通知。"

